1
00:05:53,684 --> 00:05:59,684
They have a plan!

2
00:11:47,368 --> 00:11:53,368
Battlestar Galactica: The Plan is a science fiction, action,
drama film directed by Edward James Olmos.

3
00:17:41,052 --> 00:17:47,052
When the initial Cylon attack against the Twelve Colonies fails to achieve complete extermination of human life as planned,
twin Number Ones (Cavils) embedded on Galactica and Caprica must improvise to destroy the human survivors.

4
00:23:34,736 --> 00:23:40,736
Commander William Adama, played by Edward James Olmos.

5
00:29:28,421 --> 00:29:34,421
Brother Cavil, played by Dean Stockwell.

6
00:35:22,105 --> 00:35:28,105
Samuel Anders, played by Michael Trucco.

7
00:41:15,789 --> 00:41:21,789
Lt. Sharon 'Boomer' Valerii, played by Grace Park.

8
00:47:09,473 --> 00:47:15,473
Colonel Saul Tigh, played by Michael Hogan.

9
00:53:03,157 --> 00:53:09,157
Leoben Conoy, played by Callum Keith Rennie.

10
00:58:56,842 --> 00:59:02,842
Battlestar Galactica: The Plan is a television film set in the reimagined
version of the fictional Battlestar Galactica universe.

11
01:04:50,526 --> 01:04:56,526
It consists of newly filmed material as well as a compilation of
footage from the 2003 miniseries and 2004 TV series.

12
01:10:44,210 --> 01:10:50,210
The miniseries and first two seasons of Battlestar Galactica are retold with more
emphasis on the Cylon perspective and their plan to wipe out the human race.

13
01:16:37,894 --> 01:16:43,894
The story follows two versions of the Cylon known as Cavil, one of whom admits they
may have made a mistake, with the story being told in flashback.

14
01:22:31,578 --> 01:22:37,578
The "Final Five" Cylons are featured prominently.

15
01:28:25,263 --> 01:28:31,263
The film premiered exclusively on DVD, Blu-ray Disc and
digital download on October 27, 2009.

16
01:34:18,947 --> 01:34:24,947
It premiered on January 10, 2010 on Syfy, on April 2, 2010 on Sky Premiere in
the United Kingdom, and on August 6, 2011 on Space in Canada.

17
01:40:12,631 --> 01:40:18,631
The film explores themes of fighter pilot, body double, human
heart, battlestar galactica, based on tv series.

18
01:46:06,315 --> 01:46:12,315
The tone is emotional and thought_provoking.
